# Everything listed here never reaches the Docker build context.
# Dependencies and build output are always rebuilt inside the image, for Linux.
**/node_modules
**/src/generated
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# Not needed to build any image
.git
.github
docs
deploy
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets must never be baked into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
